{
  "version": 1,
  "about": "Age tiers and the rating tables (Epic 57, story 57.01). One file for every reader: the API embeds a copy (api/internal/parental/ratings.json, kept equal by a test) and serves it at GET /api/parental/ratings; the apps read it from there. Each label has a nominal age. As content it takes the smallest tier at or above that age; as a limit it takes the largest tier at or below it.",
